prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: production 2.5D game-world transparent sprite atlas. Generate ONE beautiful raw 3-column by 2-row atlas with SIX isolated autonomous support beacons, all fully visible, exactly matching each other in shape and size. Painterly polished sunlit fantasy adventure style: cream limestone, warm clean brass/gold filigree, faceted translucent colored crystal and colored glass, crisp colored outlines, visible raised top and front/right faces in a consistent three-quarter overhead camera, upper-left sunlight. The world is a bright ivy-covered ancient courtyard with whimsical salvage machines; these are graceful tiny crystal-powered magical navigation-like devices, never rusty industrial coils, dark junk, coal, weapon chests or sci-fi UI.
Every beacon has the SAME compact circular-octagonal pale-stone and engraved brass pedestal, three small clean brass support ribs, and one tall faceted glass crystal chamber pointing upward. A physically inset symbol appears on the front of the chamber/pedestal, no floating UI label. SIX exact subjects in reading order:
top left healing beacon: soft rose pink glass crystal, small pale heart motif;
top middle resource beacon: sky-blue/cyan glass crystal, small lightning-bolt motif;
top right guard beacon: jade/teal glass crystal, little protective shield motif;
bottom left haste beacon: bright honey gold crystal, small wing/feather motif;
bottom middle damage beacon: vivid coral orange-red crystal, small crossing blade/starburst motif;
bottom right dormant beacon: same complete pedestal and crystal but quiet slate-grey lavender glass, no emitted light, tiny closed-circle motif.
Each object should occupy around 64 percent of its own equal cell width and 78 percent of cell height, keep at least 12 percent perfectly transparent gutter on all four sides, object silhouettes never cross cells. At runtime they are only 78 by 90 world units; clear simple silhouettes and legible distinct glass colors matter more than microscopic filigree. Ground-contact base center is consistent on each cell. Include only a very small attached transparent contact shadow below the pedestal, no broad painted ground, no halos, no rays, no particles, no checkerboard, no environment, no borders, no text, no numbers, no labels, no characters, no UI panel, no watermark. True clean transparent alpha background. The underlying image must show real painted objects with volume, not line-drawn SVG icons or a mockup.
